{"id":"igual","lemma":"igual","pos":"adv","rank":305,"glosses":["in the same way; just like","regardless, anyway","maybe"],"ipa":"/iˈɡwal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-igual.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tu traje es igual al mío.","en":"Your suit is the same as mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594877","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"suit"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"mine"}]},{"text":"Es igual para todo el mundo.","en":"It's the same for everyone.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581601","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"for"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,6,"everyone, everybody"]]},{"text":"¿Tienes un amigo sin igual?","en":"Do you have a best friend?","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"friend"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Eres igual que tu padre.","en":"You're just like your father.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/516144","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"father, parent"}]},{"text":"Me da igual que venga o no.","en":"It makes no difference to me whether he comes or not.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609094","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"A cheer or expression…"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"no / not"}]}]}